<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Become a Seller - MicroCart</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;600;800&display=swap');
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Outfit', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #1e293b;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
        }
        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            table-layout: fixed;
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            padding-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 32px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-top: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1 0%, #4f46e5 100%);
            padding: 60px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            position: relative;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: block;
        }
        .logo span { color: #a5b4fc; }
        .content {
            padding: 50px 40px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .footer {
            background: #f8fafc;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1 0%, #4f46e5 100%);
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.3);
        }
        h1 { margin: 0; font-weight: 800; font-size: 32px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .kyc-box {
            background: #fdf2f2;
            border: 2px dashed #f87171;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .kyc-box h3 { color: #991b1b; margin-top: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                
                                <!-- Premium CSS Logo -->
                <div style="margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
                    <div style="display: inline-block; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); position: relative; text-align: center; line-height: 72px;">
                        <span style="font-size: 38px; vertical-align: middle;">🛍️</span>
                        <div style="position: absolute; top: -4px; right: -4px; width: 14px; height: 14px; background: #fbbf24; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.8);"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -1.5px; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">
                    Micro<span style="color: #a5b4fc;">Cart</span><span style="color: #fbbf24;">.</span>
                </div>
                <h1>One Step Closer to Selling! 📈</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <p class="greeting">Hi {{name}},</p>
                <p>Welcome to the Seller community! We're excited to help you grow your business on MicroCart.</p>
                <p>To start listing products and receiving orders, you need to complete your professional profile and KYC details.</p>
                
                <div class="kyc-box">
                    <h3>Action Required: Complete KYC</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 0;">Please provide your Store Details, CNIC number, and a clear photo of your CNIC. Our team will review your application within 24-48 hours.</p>
                </div>

                <center>
                    <a href="http://localhost:3000/role-selection" class="button">Finish Setup & Start Selling</a>
                </center>
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                <p>&copy; 2026 MicroCart Inc. All rights reserved.</p>
                <p>Grow with us.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
